<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>编程题解 on Code Trails</title><link>https://qxlable.github.io/categories/%E7%BC%96%E7%A8%8B%E9%A2%98%E8%A7%A3/</link><description>Recent content in 编程题解 on Code Trails</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>qxlable@gmail.com (Qxlable)</managingEditor><webMaster>qxlable@gmail.com (Qxlable)</webMaster><copyright>QXL</copyright><lastBuildDate>Sun, 20 Jul 2025 22:10:57 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://qxlable.github.io/categories/%E7%BC%96%E7%A8%8B%E9%A2%98%E8%A7%A3/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Not_very_secure</title><link>https://qxlable.github.io/posts/not_very_secure/</link><pubDate>Sun, 20 Jul 2025 22:10:57 +0800</pubDate><author>qxlable@gmail.com (Qxlable)</author><guid>https://qxlable.github.io/posts/not_very_secure/</guid><description>&lt;h3 id="原始问题">原始问题
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>12 &amp;ndash;&amp;gt; &amp;ldquo;10 + 2&amp;rdquo;&lt;br>
45 &amp;ndash;&amp;gt; &amp;ldquo;40 + 5&amp;rdquo;&lt;br>
70304 &amp;ndash;&amp;gt; &amp;ldquo;70000 + 300 + 4&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p>
&lt;h3 id="正则表达式解法">正则表达式解法
&lt;/h3>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">6
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kn">import&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nn">re&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="n">pattern&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">re&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">compile&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;^[0-9a-zA-Z]+$&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">def&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">alphanumeric&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">):&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">pattren&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="k">match&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="ow">is&lt;/span> &lt;span class="ow">not&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">None&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>&lt;code>pattern=re.compile('^[0-9a-zA-Z]+$')&lt;/code>&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>^ (定位符，行首)&lt;/strong>&lt;br>
含义：必须从字符串的第一个字符开始匹配。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>[&amp;hellip;] (字符集：允许的字符)&lt;/strong>&lt;br>
匹配方括号内任意一个字符。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>+ (量词：一个或多个)&lt;/strong>&lt;br>
它前面的那个部分（在这里是 [&amp;hellip;] 字符集）必须至少出现一次，也可以出现很多次。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>$ (定位符：行尾)&lt;/strong>&lt;br>
必须匹配到字符串的最后一个字符。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>match&lt;/strong>&lt;br>
.match() 方法会尝试从字符串的开头进行匹配
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>如果字符串完全符合规则，.match() 会返回一个“匹配对象。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>如果字符串不符合规则，它会返回 None。&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>PS&lt;br>
使用&lt;code>r'^[\x00-\xFF]+$'&lt;/code>16进制表示整个ASCII码范围&lt;br>
使用点号 . 元字符 &lt;code>r'^.+$'&lt;/code>, 用来匹配 &lt;strong>“除换行符 \n 之外的任意单个字符”&lt;/strong>,且匹配的是所有Unicode字符&lt;br>
技巧性集合 [\s\S] 或 [\d\D], 用来匹配绝对的任意字符（包括换行符）,匹配的是所有Unicode字符&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>PS 建议加上r原始字符串，不要对其中的任何反斜杠 \ 进行转义或特殊处理。&lt;br>
加上r变为：&lt;code>pattren = re.compile(r'^[0-9a-zA-Z]+$')&lt;/code>&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote></description></item><item><title>Write_Number_in_Expanded_Form</title><link>https://qxlable.github.io/posts/write_number_in_expanded_form/</link><pubDate>Sun, 20 Jul 2025 10:57:53 +0800</pubDate><author>qxlable@gmail.com (Qxlable)</author><guid>https://qxlable.github.io/posts/write_number_in_expanded_form/</guid><description>&lt;h3 id="题目描述">题目描述
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>111&lt;/p>
&lt;h3 id="我的解法">我的解法
&lt;/h3>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">10
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">11
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">def&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">expanded_form&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">num&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">):&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">num_str&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">str&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">num&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">a&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">l&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">for&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">i&lt;/span> &lt;span class="ow">in&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">num_str&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">i&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">==&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;0&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">):&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">a&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">+=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">continue&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">l&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">append&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">i&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">+&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;0&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nb">len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">num_str&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">-&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">a&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">-&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">))&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">a&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">+=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39; + &amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">join&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">l&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;h3 id="解法一">解法一
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>使用&lt;strong>enumerate&lt;/strong>和&lt;strong>列表推导式 (List Comprehension)&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">def&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">expanded_form&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">num&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">):&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">num&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">list&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nb">str&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">num&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">))&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39; + &amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">join&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">x&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">+&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;0&amp;#39;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nb">len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">num&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">-&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">y&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">-&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">for&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">y&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">x&lt;/span> &lt;span class="ow">in&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">enumerate&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">num&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">x&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">!=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;0&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>enumerate() 函数&lt;/strong>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>这是代码中手动维护 a=0、a+=1 的完美替代品。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>enumerate 的作用是在遍历一个序列（如列表、字符串）时，&lt;strong>同时返回元素的“索引”和“值”&lt;/strong>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>在这份答案中，for y,x in enumerate(num) 就是在遍历 num 字符串时，y 得到了索引（相当于你的 a），x 得到了每个数字字符（相当于你的 i）。这样就不用自己去管理索引了。&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>列表推导式&lt;/strong>&lt;br>
基本语法为：[expression for item in iterable if condition]&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h3 id="解法二">解法二
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>纯数学方法&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">9
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">def&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">expanded_form&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">n&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">):&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">result&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="c1"># 从高位到低位遍历 (例如 70304 -&amp;gt; 从 10000 开始)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">for&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">a&lt;/span> &lt;span class="ow">in&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">range&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nb">len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nb">str&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">n&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">))&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">-&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">-&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">-&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">):&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">current&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">10&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">**&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">a&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1"># current 依次是 10000, 1000, 100, 10, 1&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">quo&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">n&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">divmod&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">n&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">current&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1"># 核心！&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">quo&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1"># 如果商不为0&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">result&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">append&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nb">str&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">quo&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">current&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">))&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39; + &amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">join&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">result&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>range(start, stop, step)&lt;/strong>&lt;br>
range(len(str(n)) - 1, -1, -1) 的意思是创建一个从 数字长度-1 开始，每次递减 1，直到 -1（但不包括-1）的序列。&lt;br>
例如，对于 70304，len 是 5。range(4, -1, -1) 会产生序列：4, 3, 2, 1, 0。&lt;br>
10 ** a 就会依次得到 10000, 1000, 100, 10, 1，正好是每一位的权重。&lt;/p>
&lt;/li>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>divmod(a, b) 函数&lt;/strong>&lt;br>
divmod 是 “division” (除法) 和 “modulo” (取模) 的缩写。它非常高效，&lt;strong>能同时返回商和余数&lt;/strong>&lt;br>
quotient, remainder = divmod(a, b) 等价于：&lt;br>
quotient = a // b&lt;br>
remainder = a % b&lt;/p>
&lt;/li>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>两个乘号 **&lt;/strong>&lt;br>
幂运算符&lt;/p>
&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h3 id="解法三">解法三
&lt;/h3>&lt;p>字符串拼接和清理&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">7
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">def&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">expanded_form&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">num&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">):&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">num&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">str&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">num&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">st&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;&amp;#39;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">for&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">j&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">i&lt;/span> &lt;span class="ow">in&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">enumerate&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">num&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">):&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">i&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">!=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;0&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">st&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">+=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39; + &lt;/span>&lt;span class="si">{}{}&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">format&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">i&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nb">len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">num&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">j&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">+&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:])&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;0&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">))&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">st&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">strip&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39; +&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>字符串切片 num[j+1:]&lt;/strong>&lt;br>
字符串 num 的第 j+1 个位置开始，一直取到字符串的末尾&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>.format() 字符串格式化&lt;/strong>&lt;br>
&amp;lsquo;{}{}&amp;rsquo;.format(a, b) 是将变量 a 和 b 填充到字符串的 {} 占位符中。这是一种比用 + 拼接更推荐的字符串构建方式。
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>使用 &lt;strong>f-string&lt;/strong> 来替代 format 函数&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="n">zeros&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">num&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">j&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">+&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:])&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;0&amp;#39;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="n">st&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">+=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="sa">f&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39; + &lt;/span>&lt;span class="si">{&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">i&lt;/span>&lt;span class="si">}{&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">zeros&lt;/span>&lt;span class="si">}&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>.strip() 方法&lt;/strong>&lt;br>
因为它的循环逻辑是 st += &amp;rsquo; + &amp;hellip;&amp;rsquo;，所以第一次添加时，字符串的开头就会多出一个 &amp;rsquo; + &amp;lsquo;，例如 + 70000 + 300 + 4。&lt;br>
st.strip(&amp;rsquo; +&amp;rsquo;) 的作用是移除字符串开头和结尾的所有空格和 + 号，把多余的部分清理干净。&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>Counting_smiley_faces</title><link>https://qxlable.github.io/posts/counting_smiley_faces/</link><pubDate>Sat, 19 Jul 2025 21:28:36 +0800</pubDate><author>qxlable@gmail.com (Qxlable)</author><guid>https://qxlable.github.io/posts/counting_smiley_faces/</guid><description>&lt;h3 id="解法一-自己的解法">解法一 自己的解法
&lt;/h3>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">10
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">11
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">12
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">13
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">14
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">15
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">16
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">17
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">def&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">count_smileys&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">arr&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">):&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="c1">#the number of valid smiley faces in array/list&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nb">sum&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">for&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">s&lt;/span> &lt;span class="ow">in&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">arr&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">==&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;:&amp;#39;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="ow">or&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">==&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;;&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">==&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;-&amp;#39;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="ow">or&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">==&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;~&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">==&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;)&amp;#39;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="ow">or&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">==&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;D&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nb">sum&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">+=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">else&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">continue&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">elif&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">==&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;)&amp;#39;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="ow">or&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">==&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;D&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nb">sum&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">+=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">else&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">continue&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">else&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">continue&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">sum&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>语言使用还是不太符合python规范。&lt;/p>
&lt;h3 id="解法二-改版">解法二 改版：
&lt;/h3>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">10
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">11
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">12
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">13
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">14
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">15
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">16
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">17
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">18
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">19
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">def&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">count_smileys&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">arr&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">):&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="c1">#采用 not in + 列表的方式来实现上述or实现的内容&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">count&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">for&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">s&lt;/span> &lt;span class="ow">in&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">arr&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="ow">not&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;lt;=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nb">len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">&amp;lt;=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">3&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">):&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">continue&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="ow">not&lt;/span> &lt;span class="ow">in&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;:&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;;&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">continue&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">==&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="ow">in&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;)&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;D&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">count&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">+=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">else&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">continue&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">==&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">3&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="ow">not&lt;/span> &lt;span class="ow">in&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;-&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;~&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">continue&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">2&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="ow">in&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;)&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;D&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]:&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">count&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">+=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">count&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;h3 id="解法三-正则表达式">解法三 正则表达式
&lt;/h3>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kn">import&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nn">re&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">def&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">count_smileys&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">arr&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">):&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">re&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">findall&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="sa">r&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;[:;][-~]?[)D]&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">join&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">arr&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)))&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>re为正则表达式的库&lt;/li>
&lt;li>re.findall输出的是符合整个正则表达式的一个列表，使用len来输出长度&lt;/li>
&lt;li>r&amp;quot;&amp;quot;：前面的 r 表示这是一个“原始字符串 (raw string)”，这是写正则表达式时的好习惯，可以避免一些符号的转义问题。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&amp;ldquo;&amp;quot;.join将列表整个连起来成为一个字符串，方便查找。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>? 这是一个量词，它紧跟在鼻子 [-~] 后面，表示 &lt;strong>“它前面的那个部分（鼻子）可以出现 0 次或 1 次 ”&lt;/strong>&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>我的第一篇 Codewars 题解</title><link>https://qxlable.github.io/posts/my-first-codewars-solution/</link><pubDate>Sat, 19 Jul 2025 08:52:34 +0800</pubDate><author>qxlable@gmail.com (Qxlable)</author><guid>https://qxlable.github.io/posts/my-first-codewars-solution/</guid><description>&lt;h3 id="解法一自己的解法">解法一：自己的解法
&lt;/h3>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">7
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">def&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">digital_root&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">n&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">):&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">n_str&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">str&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">n&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>&lt;span class="c1">#将整数转化为字符串&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">totle&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">sum&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nb">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">char&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">for&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">char&lt;/span> &lt;span class="ow">in&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">n_str&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">#强制类型转换&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">while&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">totle&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">//&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">10&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">!=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>
